    "standardized_narrative": "At 1 January 2020 Syndicate 318 had gross claims outstanding of GBP 189.346m. During calendar year 2020 the Syndicate recorded a gross prioryear release of GBP 91.394m (48.3% of opening gross reserves), driven primarily by favourable claims development on earlier underwriting years. While 2020 itself was materially affected by a number of natural catastrophe events (notably Hurricanes Laura, Sally, Delta and Zeta) and COVID19 related losses, the movement in prior year provisions was a net release, reflecting improved experience and reserve development on closed years.",
    "raw_causal_phrases": [
      "On a positive note, the reserves established at last year end in respect of 2017 year of account and prior years have developed favourably during 2020. This has resulted in a release of GBP 8.5m which has improved the overall result.",
      "In 2020 there has been an improvement of GBP 8.2m on closed year reserves, which makes up just over half of the result.",
      "Favourable movements of GBP 23.2m, (2019: GBP 10.3m), in the past year's provision for claims outstanding and IBNR, net of expected reinsurance recoveries, are included in claims incurred, net of reinsurance."
